README
======

Device tree for DE0-Nano-SoC Kit/Atlas-SoC Kit
----------------------------------------------

To build, copy "socfpga_cyclone5_de0_sockit_vxe.dts" file to "linux-socfpga/arch/arm/boot/dts".

Then run make, using ARM as a target, for example:

 > make ARCH=arm CROSS_COMPILE=arm-none-eabi- O=<build_dir> socfpga_cyclone5_de0_sockit_vxe.dtb

where <build_dir> is a build directory path.

To use, copy "<build_dir>/arch/arm/boot/dts/socfpga_cyclone5_de0_sockit_vxe.dtb" file to
U-Boot partition on SD card and modify boot script (boot.script) as the following example:

---< boot.script >---
  # Set the devicetree image to be used
  setenv fdtimage socfpga_cyclone5_de0_sockit_vxe.dtb;

  # Set the kernel image to be used
  setenv bootimage zImage-4.14.130-ltsi-altera;
---< boot.script >---

Then create a new config image for U-Boot:

 > mkimage -T script -d boot.script u-boot.scr
